          "The class is at nine."
        ],
        [
          "¿Cuándo es la fiesta?",
          "When is the party?"
        ],
        [
          "La fiesta es a las ocho.",
          "The party is at eight."
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "examples",
      "items": [
        {
          "spanish": "¿A qué hora es la clase?",
          "english": "What time is the class?"
        },
        {
          "spanish": "La clase es a las nueve.",
          "english": "The class is at nine."
